Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:56.40,Title,0,0,0,0,,《第一滴血4》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.94,0:00:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份报告披露了从未被了解的情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something they had never seen, which liberated a yellow,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.07,0:00:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关恐怖的暴力情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}very pungent and acrid vapor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在缅甸 态度强硬的军政府{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The actions of the hard-line mliitary regime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.57,0:00:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,国际社会对其强硬政权行径的担忧 与日俱增{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are the cause of increasing international concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.66,0:00:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,该政权为自己所作予以辩护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The regime crushes all dissent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,缅甸西部的一些族群正被镇压{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethnic groups are being oppressed in the east of the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.75,0:00:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,外国记者很少能够进入此地采访{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and foreign journalists are rarely…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,据称 缅甸使用了早期化学武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…claim tonight that some form of chemical weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.59,0:00:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,施行灭绝平民百姓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been used in Burma by mliitary rulers…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.75,0:00:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,引起了大众的不满情绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has led to the national uprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.51,0:00:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,几千人在街上被屠杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands took to the streets and thousands were killed…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多和平抗议的僧侣被杀害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Burma, many peaceful protesting monks have been killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:01:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是被活埋就是被淹死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}some burned alive, and others drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.18,0:01:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,外国新闻工作者也不幸遇害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foreign journalists have been shot and killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,无数村庄被摧毁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As thousands of villages have been destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,强奸和私刑每天在发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}rape and torture are a daliy occurrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,缅甸埋的地雷数量全球第一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Burma, there are more land mines than anywhere in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.69,0:01:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻人被殴打并强行征召入伍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young men are beaten and forced into the army,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.90,0:01:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多人只有十二岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}many as young as 12 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,斩首随处可见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beheadings and mutliations are commonplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.15,0:01:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,克伦族人大多顺从{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Karen people, comprised mostly of poor Christian farmers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.07,0:01:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,贫穷的农民基督教徒刻意被处决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have been singled out for extermination.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.32,0:01:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,缅甸军政府觊觎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ruling mliitary government.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,克伦族的自然资源已久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}wants the abundant natural resources on Karen land.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.87,0:01:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,缅甸政府军针对克伦族的血腥行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bloody Burmese mliitary campaign against the Karen people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.71,0:01:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,持续了几乎60年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been going on for almost 60 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是世界上最长的内战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the longest running civli war in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.29,0:06:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 这两条蛇 他们是暹罗眼镜蛇或普通眼镜蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two snake that you see, they are Siamese cobra or common cobra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:20.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（泰国 美索镇）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是眼镜蛇王或射毒眼镜蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not king cobra and not spitting cobra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.03,0:06:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.93,0:06:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,袋子给他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.95,0:06:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还需要一只蟒蛇 你去抓来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼镜蛇太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开 行吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck off, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.03,0:06:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们还是有毒性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They still have fang and still have poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是很小 最危险 位居第一的毒蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is small, dangerous, number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二是眼镜蛇王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}King cobra number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是射毒眼镜蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now spitting cobra.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会射毒液向你的双眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can spit poison to your eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种颜色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One color.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.97,0:07:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是非常非常危险的毒蛇 在泰国是最毒的毒蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's very, very dangerous. Number one in Thailand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万要小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来是危险的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like dangerous work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是 麦可·伯内特 能谈谈吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Michael Burnett. Do you have some time to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.11,0:07:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会耽搁太久 我保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't take long, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.07,0:07:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说可以找你租船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told it might be possible to rent your boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.33,0:07:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意愿吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去河上游{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that possible? We need to get upriver.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去哪里 - 缅甸境内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where you going? - Into Burma.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,缅甸是战区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burma's a war zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 外界是这么说的 说是种族屠杀还差不多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's what people call it, but it's more like genocide than war.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我第五次进去了 我们都明白进去的风险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, this will be my fifth trip in, so we are aware of all the risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.22,0:07:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不去北边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't go that far north.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me explain our situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.39,0:08:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们隶属在科罗拉多的泛亚洲牧师团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our church is part of a Pan-Asian ministry located in Colorado,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是今年度的义工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're all volunteers who around this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.61,0:08:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要为克伦部落的人带去医药和救治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bring in medical supplies, medical attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷书和我们的支持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}prayer books and support for the Karen tribes people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你比任何人都熟悉这条河{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People say you know the river better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.95,0:08:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗人的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.04,0:08:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望能雇用你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what I'm asking is that we compensate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,只花你几小时时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a few hours of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以帮助我们改善难民生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will help change people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们有带任何武器吗 - 当然没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you bringing in any weapons? - Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们什么都改变不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not changing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.39,0:08:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道要让世界继续这样 而不管吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's thinking like that that keeps the world the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.73,0:08:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧 - 为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.90,0:08:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没兴趣 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not interested. Let's just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.07,0:08:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我试试 - 不 莎拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me try. - No, Sarah…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过这是唯一的办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, didn't you say it was the only way up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 我们也没什么可损失 是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know I did… - All right, then what do we have to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:08:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我和他说说 - 就让我试试 麦可{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I talked to the man… - Just let me try, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莎拉 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sarah… - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.97,0:09:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是 莎拉·米勒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sarah Miller.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.68,0:09:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不介意我又回来找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you don't mind me coming back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才你和他说话的那个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man that you were talking to…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.19,0:09:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没和任何人说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't talking to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那刚才和你说话的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man that was talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,问你是否愿意借船带我们去上游{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}asked if we could hire you to take us up the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不愿意 为什么 - 我帮不上忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said no. Why? - Can't help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.49,0:09:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以听听你拒绝的理由吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you have good reasons, would you mind if I heard them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.25,0:11:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.67,0:12:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以重新考虑吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you reconsider?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.84,0:12:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我不知道你的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know anything about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.60,0:12:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像也不关心发生的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it seems like you don't care to know anything about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你住这么近 这里都这么多难民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you live so close to what's going on over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的无动于衷吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, doesn't it bother you at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,说过了帮不上忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 我们应该离开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, we should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为人就放在这里 死无理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe that people are put here to die for no reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.63,0:12:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,或相信时间就可以改变一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or believe in giving time to something other than yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你相信吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, do you believe in anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.43,0:12:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的应该走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really ought to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.65,0:13:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这男的并不在乎 我们再想想办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man doesn't care. We'll figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.68,0:13:18.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（缅甸 塔克和德村-巴本行政区）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.29,0:13:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 别抓我儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:14:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些孩子是我们的士兵了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.42,0:14:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在属于我了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有人想把他们救回去 就把你们整个村子烧了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.04,0:14:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你们敢去找克伦反抗军帮忙 我就割掉你们的舌头
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你们敢反抗我 我就用你们的肠子喂你们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我 信我 怕我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么又回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说过了帮不上忙 - 为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you before, I can't help you. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你朋友在哪里 - 酒店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are your friends? - At the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.03,0:15:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以照顾自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that so? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:16:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你不喜欢我们 - 我可没说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know you don't like us. - I never said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上来却是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须去帮助那些人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to go and help these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you helping?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.38,0:16:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们或者是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them or you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.71,0:16:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有关系吗 - 当然有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does it matter? - Yeah, it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.09,0:16:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让生活留白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing missing in our lives back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这儿就是为了改变现状{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.64,0:16:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们坚信每个生命都是珍贵的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe all lives are special.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有些是 有些不是 - 真的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Some lives, some, no. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果每个人都这么想 那什么都改变不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If everyone thought like you, nothing would ever change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.10,0:16:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何事都改变不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing does change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.19,0:16:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是 没什么是不会变的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it does. Nothing stays the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.69,0:16:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好的过你的生活吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live your life, 'cause you got a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正是我尝试做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what I'm trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.03,0:16:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你尝试做的是改变它原来的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, what you're trying to do is change what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.20,0:16:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么样子 - 我们像动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And what is? - That we're like animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗的血液在你身上流窜 别抗拒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the blood. It's natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,和平 这是一个意外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace, that's an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.88,0:16:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你被压迫 杀人就像是呼吸一样的简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're pushed, killing is as easy as breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.22,0:16:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当某个地方停止杀戮 另一个地方却再开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the killing stops in one place and it starts in another,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.89,0:17:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是为了你的国家去杀戮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's okay 'cause you're killing for your country.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它不是你国家的要求 它只是某些高层的意愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it ain't your country who's asking. It's a few men up top who want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,先人开例 后人顺从{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old men start it, young men fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有赢家 每个人都在过程中死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody wins, everybody in the middle dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有人告诉真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nobody tells the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.61,0:17:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝会再让一切消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's gonna make all that go away?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.84,0:17:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要浪费你的生命 我做到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't waste your life. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.68,0:17:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.14,0:17:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 回去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.25,0:18:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在乎 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You care. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有些事是你关心的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不关心 你可以带我们去那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you didn't, you would have taken us there,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.76,0:18:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,赚取金钱就算了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}taken the money and be done with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.47,0:18:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你并没有这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.86,0:18:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你失去了对人的信念{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you've lost your faith in people,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一定还有些事是你相信的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you must still be faithful to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.08,0:18:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我热爱我的生活 我不想失去它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I love my life and I don't want to lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:19:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但尝试去拯救生命 并不浪费人生 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But trying to save a life isn't wasting your life, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我们吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.53,0:19:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.72,0:19:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,像那些如此邪恶的人 终究会输的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As bad as these people are, they will eventually lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不能一直跟联合阵线对抗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't keep it up against a united front. They can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.56,0:19:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间会证明一切的 但同时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, time alone will tell, but in the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.39,0:19:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须团结一致{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just have to help hold it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.81,0:19:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,前几天 我读了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, just the other day, I read…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.82,0:19:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:19:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 你要去哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.86,0:20:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他聊聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.53,0:20:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能不想被烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he probably wants his privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.49,0:20:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦可 你不该无视他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, you shouldn't ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.99,0:20:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他帮了我们 - 我们已经付他钱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's helping us. - He's been paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么都没拿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't take anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.71,0:20:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次感谢你 谢谢帮我们 真的 我们所有人都感谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, again, for doing this. Really. From all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.76,0:20:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里永远看起来都是一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the same view goes on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里是如此的空旷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so empty out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只是看起来这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.98,0:20:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 你还没跟我们说你的名字呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you never told us your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰 - 约翰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John. - John.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.28,0:20:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在这里住了很久吗 - 好久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lived here a long time? - Long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.91,0:20:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从哪来的 - 亚利桑纳州的包威市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where you from? - Bowie, Arizona. Small place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.79,0:20:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边你都做些什么呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you do there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.38,0:20:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要都是农场养马的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worked horses, mainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为何离开呢 - 我被征召去打越战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why'd you leave? - I got drafted in Nam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.97,0:21:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很久了 - 已经有好多年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Long time ago. - Long time ago. Lot of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.93,0:21:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就一直待下来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just stayed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一言难尽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.43,0:21:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 家里还有亲人吗 - 父亲吧 不太清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have family back home? - Father maybe. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.11,0:21:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不好奇家乡有什么变化吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you curious to see how things might've changed back home?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去也要有个理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to have a reason for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.33,0:21:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从事什么工作 - 老师 第六级{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you do stateside? - I teach. Sixth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.68,0:21:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我终于了解为何你 总是这么多问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I know why you ask so many questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.81,0:22:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有多远啊 - 还要几个小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any idea how much longer? - Yeah, just a few more hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.19,0:22:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们应该让这男人有自己的空间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should give the man his space.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.99,0:22:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈谈时间表 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go over the schedule, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙回自己的事情 它可是个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're engaged. He's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.38,0:22:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.13,0:22:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你以为你自己是孤独的 但总有某些东西会推动你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think you live alone out here, but there's always something pushing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.40,0:23:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 他们是谁 - 缅甸的海盗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? Who are they? - Burmese pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.78,0:23:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,都坐下 别出声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell everyone to stay down, don't make a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.58,0:23:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是谁 - 没事 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are they? - It's all right, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.54,0:23:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是… - 别说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just keep… - Don't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.20,0:24:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有人吗 - 或许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any more of them? - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.25,0:24:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you wanna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.83,0:24:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续前进 我们说好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should keep going. We made a commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.09,0:24:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想要怎么做 - 我们是一起的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you wanna do? - We're a group here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.59,0:24:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们是要这船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they wanna vote…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.30,0:24:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐下 - 如果他们是要钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sit down! - If it's money they want…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.14,0:24:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静 头低下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody talks. Heads down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.19,0:24:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,把头低下 别直视他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your heads down and nobody look them in the eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.07,0:24:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会杀光你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or they'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.20,0:25:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有灯 快打亮
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.62,0:25:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看清楚你们这些笨蛋 快
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.60,0:25:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一区河域归我们管
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.60,0:25:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想通过
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.00,0:25:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以马上干掉你们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.90,0:25:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为何不尊重我们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.90,0:25:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尊重你们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.90,0:25:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们船上的所有财物
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.00,0:25:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些白种笨蛋要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.00,0:25:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,送药给病人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.00,0:25:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.00,0:25:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是女人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.00,0:25:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她带过来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.00,0:25:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走财物 别动她
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.00,0:25:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.00,0:26:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她带过来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.00,0:26:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会交出钱
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.00,0:26:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还用说 把她带过来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.00,0:26:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会交出全部的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.50,0:26:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.80,0:26:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来 婊子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.00,0:26:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次 把她带过来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.00,0:26:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则就杀光你们
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.72,0:26:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.23,0:26:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么好事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.32,0:26:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这是为了停止杀戮的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came here to help stop the killing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.11,0:26:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭什么 怎么能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you to…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.19,0:26:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你算老几 - 放开他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.99,0:27:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会强奸她至死 再砍掉你们的头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would've raped her 50 times, and cut your heads off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.45,0:27:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going back!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.83,0:27:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们不能回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, we shouldn't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.50,0:27:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想干嘛 - 不能带我们回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Don't take us back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.55,0:27:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里发生的事很恐怖 - 我们就快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look what just happened! - We got through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.34,0:27:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们明年再回来 - 我们就快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll come back next year. - We are so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.51,0:27:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦可 这是你的主意 我们承诺过的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael, this was your idea. We made a commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.51,0:27:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不会认同我们所为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't believe in what we're doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.35,0:27:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这就是我们的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's our life, our choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.69,0:27:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 求你 约翰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.36,0:27:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.45,0:27:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们改变不了任何事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going to change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.09,0:27:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去坐好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.35,0:28:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.02,0:28:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回程会走陆路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be taking the overland route on the way back,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.07,0:29:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用等我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so there's no need to wait around.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.70,0:29:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会呈报这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to report this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.86,0:29:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你觉得自己做的对 但是杀人永远都是不对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think what you did was right, but taking a life is never right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.89,0:29:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该说些什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.35,0:29:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你什么都不必说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you shouldn't say anything, should you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.69,0:31:37.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（劳佬村）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.39,0:32:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.84,0:32:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.37,0:33:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.38,0:33:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,籍着力量 穿过他的灵魂 进入你的内心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through his spirit in your inner being.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.35,0:33:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样主与信念就能在你的心中长存{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Christ may dwell in your hearts with faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.10,0:33:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈祷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I pray…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.07,0:33:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们将与我们一起获得力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you may have the power together…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.03,0:33:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我试试看 能不能修好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see if I can fix this little problem, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.41,0:34:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.46,0:34:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.17,0:34:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿绷带给我好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand me one of those bandages?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.51,0:34:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.14,0:34:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.14,0:34:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.57,0:34:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快出去 - 他们怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of here! - What about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.82,0:34:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 我带他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on! Take them!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.64,0:37:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你对人失去了信任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you've lost your faith in people,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.31,0:37:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你还是很在乎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you must still be faithful to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.35,0:37:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是会对某人关心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still care about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.96,0:38:14.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（缅甸国家和平和发展委员会 轻步兵第360营）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.25,0:39:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个带出去关到猪舍
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.76,0:39:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 呼叫乌鸦 请回话 乌鸦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Company leader calling Raven. Come on, Raven.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.43,0:39:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是谁 是你造就了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I? You made me this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.97,0:39:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个天生热血的战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A full-blooded combat soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.93,0:39:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是不肯结束它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.60,0:39:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话啊 约翰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.73,0:40:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是不肯结束它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.23,0:40:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 结束了 - 没有事情会结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's over. - Nothing is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.73,0:40:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候你才能回来呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are you gonna come full circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.32,0:40:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你为什么来这 约翰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the reasons you're here, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.99,0:40:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不想看看家乡变成什么样了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you curious to see how things might've changed back home?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.49,0:40:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经造成够多的伤害了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done enough damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.29,0:40:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你与自己妥协{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're always going to be tearing away at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.29,0:40:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,并回到原点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}untli you come to terms with what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.46,0:40:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你将一直被自己的恐惧驱使{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Untli you come full circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.38,0:40:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要一直待下去吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're just going to stay here forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.96,0:40:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰 - 我要回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John! - I wanna go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.38,0:40:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·蓝波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Rambo!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.97,0:40:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.26,0:40:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·蓝波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Rambo?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.98,0:40:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫 亚瑟·马许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Arthur Marsh,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.98,0:40:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,科罗拉多基督会的牧师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}pastor of the Christ Church of Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.53,0:40:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得和你谈谈 事关紧急{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to talk with you. It's very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.32,0:40:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我不会在这种天气来访的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't come here like this if it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.62,0:41:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,援助小队离开的那天早上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The morning of the day the group left,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.21,0:41:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦可·伯内特 通知了我 他们从这里出发的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael Burnett notified me that they were traveling from this location.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.72,0:41:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出什么事了 - 事实上 没人知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - No one knows exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.89,0:41:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们本该10天前就返回 到现在都没出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were supposed to return 10 days ago, but they never came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.47,0:41:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我寻求大使馆的帮助 但他们无能为力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I requested help from the embassy, but they can't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.52,0:41:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在缅甸 在这时机 真的没办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in Burma, and not in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.94,0:41:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎知他们还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know they're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.02,0:41:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们联络上了克伦自由组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we've been in contact with the Karen freedom fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.53,0:41:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说知道小队成员被带到哪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who say they think they know where they were taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.45,0:41:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大使馆给我一个退役美军的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was given the name of an ex-military American local from the embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.28,0:41:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,说他们一伙在这方面很有经验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who put me in touch with men who say they have experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.75,0:41:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这方面很有经验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this part of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.29,0:41:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,雇佣兵吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mercenaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.21,0:41:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.42,0:41:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.88,0:41:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道正确的地点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the exact spot. We need you to take these men.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.09,0:41:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你把这些人带到那里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to where you let our people off.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.76,0:41:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们何时要出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are they ready to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.80,0:42:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,由你决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.89,0:42:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你不应该帮得上忙吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you gonna say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.27,0:42:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不明白 - 你应该会明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't understand. - You should.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.52,0:42:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是祈祷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean a prayer?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.23,0:42:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是为我 是为他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for me, for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.69,0:42:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.37,0:42:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.49,0:42:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我成为你手中的傀儡吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}make me your instrument of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.16,0:42:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里有仇恨 就让我把爱带到那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there is hatred, let me bring love.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.38,0:42:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里有伤害 就让我把宽恕带到那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there is injury, pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.42,0:42:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里有疑问 就让我把信念带到那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there is doubt, faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.97,0:42:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里有绝望 就让我把希望带到那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there is despair, hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.68,0:42:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里有黑暗 就让我把光明带到那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there is darkness, light.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.23,0:42:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里有悲伤 就让我把喜悦带到那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there is sadness, joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.11,0:42:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,当需要安慰时不需费力地寻求安慰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grant that I may not seek to be consoled as to console,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.11,0:43:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,少求被了解 但求了解人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be understood as to understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.70,0:43:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,少求爱 但求全心付出爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be loved as to love,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.66,0:43:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们得到了 所以我们应该付出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for it is in giving that we receive.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.13,0:43:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们面临死亡我们会在来世重新醒过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is in dying that we awake to eternal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.20,0:44:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这鬼地方 只有他妈的猴子 才会住在这吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this fucking place. Only a fucking ape would live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.49,0:44:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈的来这干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.70,0:44:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 别再讲那些屁话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, knock that shit off.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.96,0:44:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不欣赏文艺吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}En-Joo don't like the arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.50,0:44:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不欣赏大便啦 - 但我欣赏你姐姐 迪亚兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- En-Joo don't like shit. - I like your sister, Diaz.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.42,0:44:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她喜欢智障{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got a thing for retards.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.21,0:44:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个牧师跟你说了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what did the Reverend say to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.47,0:44:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些笨蛋走丢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some shit about part of his flock going missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.55,0:44:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说那是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said to him, "Look, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.89,0:44:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,乱闯缅甸的结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"That's what you get when you go trespassing into fucking Burma.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.97,0:44:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱管闲事就是这种下场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"That's what you get when you go sniffing around other people's garbage."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.35,0:44:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的将军们制造的毒品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, those generals in there are making a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.65,0:44:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,比地球上任何地方都多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions cranking out meth more than any other place on the fucking planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.31,0:44:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,唬烂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.61,0:45:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赚上百万啊 - 白痴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Millions, moron. - Hell, yeah, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.36,0:45:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你以为他们拿什么养军队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think they pay for that shit army?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.57,0:45:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的将军 都他妈的是瘾君子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking generals, biggest junkies of all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.41,0:45:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很崇高的 路易士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's noble, Lewis.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.37,0:45:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.91,0:45:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些手无寸铁地进入战区的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people going in there with no weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.41,0:45:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只带了书籍和药品 很崇高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just books and meds. It's noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.71,0:45:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,学童{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi, School Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.33,0:45:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭着崇高理想来淌浑水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stick your noble nose into other people's business,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.09,0:45:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,下场不是很惨 就是死路一条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get fucked up or you get dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.50,0:45:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为了前妻及三个孩子 才来冒险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only reason I'm doing this is for an ex-wife and three kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.22,0:45:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后 我绝不过这种卖命日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after this shit is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.47,0:45:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想还没到达就老死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can shove that soldiering right up your arse.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.05,0:45:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 船夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi, boat man. Come on, chop-chop!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.43,0:45:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,早去才能早回啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The quicker we get there, the quicker we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.11,0:45:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶的传道士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lousy God-squadders.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.61,0:45:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来这里 滔滔不绝地布道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They come over here spouting all that shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.95,0:45:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还梦想全世界跟他们相亲相爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they expect the whole world to work like their fucking neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.45,0:45:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.62,0:45:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们派了个魔鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they send in the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.04,0:46:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,来做上帝的工作 不是很讽刺吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to do God's work. It's ironic, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.21,0:46:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是让你觉得很无聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I boring you, mate?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.63,0:46:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是旅程的关系 让你紧张了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, is it… Is it the trip? Has it got you nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.31,0:46:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该感谢这次行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause, really, you should appreciate the action.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.31,0:46:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.56,0:46:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比抓蛇强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to be better than looking at the arse end of a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.23,0:46:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.27,0:46:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个狠角色是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really are an uptight bastard, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.45,0:46:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,少用怪眼神瞪我了 我见过各种人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can drop the 1, 000-yard stare. I've seen it all before,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.37,0:46:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你唬不了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm not impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.13,0:46:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是传统老派的英国SAS特种部队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's old school SAS.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.05,0:46:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一流的狂热军人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're first-rate soldiers, but total egomaniacs.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.06,0:46:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是SBS出身的 我们不这么重手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, us SBS boys, we're not so heavy-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.52,0:46:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们喜欢用脑 明白吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We like to use our brains. You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.57,0:47:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫我“学童”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call me School Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.53,0:47:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这名字从狙击学校开始就跟着我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name stuck with me since sniper school.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.20,0:47:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我杀了多少人 我的同伴还是用这名字叫我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me mates won't stop calling me it no matter how many people I shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.23,0:47:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟要拿我们怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.31,0:48:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一大一小 在搞笑是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One man and a kid. You gotta be fucking joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.64,0:48:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,反抗军就这么一点人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This all the rebels they put up?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.44,0:48:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怎么喜欢这地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not liking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.61,0:48:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们身在丛林当中 什么都不妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in a fucking jungle, puss nuts. There's nothing to like.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.77,0:48:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.53,0:48:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫班恩 他是泰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Myint. This is Tha.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.07,0:48:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就你们俩 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this it? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.86,0:48:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这小孩怎么回事 - 他是个敏锐的追踪者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up with the kid, man? - He good tracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.83,0:48:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要狗屁追踪者 是需要向导{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need a tracker. We need a fucking guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.12,0:48:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道正确地点吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the exact location, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.71,0:48:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,向西10公里朝北 抄捷径只要六公里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten kilometers west, two north, six to a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.13,0:48:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有多少士兵 - 大概有一百个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many soldiers? - Hundred, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.79,0:48:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一百个 - 没说错吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hundred? - What'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.50,0:48:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天还会增援更多新兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More new soldiers come tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.80,0:48:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我是个白人老粗 但我还会算数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know I'm just a white trash grunt, but I can count.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.55,0:48:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百个步兵怎么打{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck fucking with 100 strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.80,0:48:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 把话说明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, all right. Let's get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.60,0:49:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不跟人交战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't engage anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.14,0:49:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能救出那些志工 那正好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can extract these people, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.52,0:49:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但得速战速决 不然我们就闪人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's in, out, clean, or we fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.19,0:49:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人可以告诉我船夫要干嘛吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody wanna tell me what the boat man's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.90,0:49:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不跟船待在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, why ain't you waiting with the boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.19,0:49:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人会在船上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men are staying with the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.49,0:49:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的船 你就要待在那{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the boat man. You stay with the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.66,0:49:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会拖累你们 - 对 你不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I won't slow you down. - Yeah, I know you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.37,0:49:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们又不是去远足 - 就信他吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not a fucking nature hike. - Believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.62,0:49:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他可以掩护我们 - 他是船夫 他就得顾船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He can hang with me at the back. - Hey, hey, he stays here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.29,0:49:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就要跟船待在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the boat man. He stays with the fucking boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.33,0:49:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要白人顾船 不要土人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a white man on, and not some fucking dink.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.34,0:49:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁有炸药 图斯托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now who's got explosives? Tombstone?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.00,0:49:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 我有一些塑胶炸药和雷管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- None. - A pound of C-4 and primer.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.38,0:49:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个定向地雷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a claymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.18,0:49:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's get on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.35,0:49:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 前进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, move, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.01,0:50:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么鬼 - 高脚炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the fuck is that? - Called Tallboy bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.47,0:50:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国佬在二战时投下的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}English drop in World War ll.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.08,0:50:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的人 就在这里被掳走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people taken from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.75,0:50:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 真是不堪入目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I have seen some shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.92,0:50:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 简直是惨不忍睹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, I ain't never seen no shit like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.51,0:51:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,军队来过了 他们杀光一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armies come. Kill everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.22,0:51:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,并弃尸以示警告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave our dead here as warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.54,0:51:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰 快回家 快
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.77,0:51:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He see enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.19,0:51:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处布满地雷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.19,0:51:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你们脚下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch where you walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.46,0:51:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 我们继续前进 - 有什么用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, let's move on. - To what?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.87,0:51:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们连狗都杀 那些人死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They even killed the fucking dogs. Those people are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.59,0:51:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with En-Joo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.71,0:51:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们至少得去确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We at least have to go and have a look-see, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.92,0:51:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意 至少侦查一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with you. Let's check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.05,0:51:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,侦查个鸟 他们有上百个士兵耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check what? They're 100 strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.68,0:51:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 我们拿钱做事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we took the man's money.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.97,0:51:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 冷静点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.72,0:51:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just calm down, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.23,0:51:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去 看情况如何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go there, and we'll see what's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.60,0:51:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要不对劲 有任何动静 我们就闪人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if anything's wrong, anything at all, we'll leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.57,0:51:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.53,0:51:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.36,0:52:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.16,0:52:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走哪边 - 这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which way? - This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.33,0:52:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是军队 快躲起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Army! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.56,0:52:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,要开枪吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to fire on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.82,0:52:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不 他们如果没有回营{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! They don't make it back from wherever the hell they came from,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.48,0:52:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就曝光了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}man, they are on to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.64,0:52:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿着钱
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.80,0:52:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赌这个挺到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.55,0:52:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在搞什么鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck are they doing, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.47,0:54:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们多长时间能被发现
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.90,0:54:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,3个小时 或者4个
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.72,0:54:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,船夫 你是何方神圣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you, boat man? Where'd you learn to kill like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.14,0:54:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.23,0:54:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 这些家伙们到时候没回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna come hunting our asses down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.56,0:54:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会被追杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when these guys don't show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.94,0:54:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为这些军人没回营{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got people to live for, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.44,0:54:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要淌浑水 我们回船上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need this shit. We're going back to the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.61,0:54:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以 你不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.78,0:54:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.03,0:54:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a fuck who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.82,0:54:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有种再说一次 我发誓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say another word and I swear on my kids' eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.03,0:54:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.16,0:54:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.54,0:54:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.51,0:55:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.31,0:55:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有人想死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there isn't one of us that doesn't want to be someplace else,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.56,0:55:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们所该做的 代表了我们是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is what we do, who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.57,0:55:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,苟且偷生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live for nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.11,0:55:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是死得其所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or die for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.37,0:55:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.98,0:55:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.86,0:55:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.25,0:55:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,上路吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.92,0:56:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一但学童到了塔上 我们只有15分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once School Boy's on the tower, we got 15 minutes.
